nt":1320,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","cmake","cplusplus","cpp","libraries","package-manager","packages","vcpkg","visual-studio","windows"],"visibility":"public","forks":7235,"open_issues":1320,"watchers":26254,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/pulls/10285","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/10285","diff_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/10285.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/10285.patch","merged_at":"2020-04-24T21:03:46Z"},"body":"**Describe the pull request**\r\n`boost-modular-build-helper` builds a `CXXFLAGS` variable (containing `user-config.jam` compiler command-line options) to pass to `b2`. When `CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_TARGET` is specified (which it is for Android builds) then the `CXXFLAGS` value is appended with `<compileflags>${CMAKE_CXX_COMPILE_OPTIONS_TARGET} <compileflags>${CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_TARGET}`, which is correct for gcc's command-line options. But Clang expects no space between `${CMAKE_CXX_COMPILE_OPTIONS_TARGET}` and `${CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_TARGET}`. In order to build for Clang this PR adds a [`CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID`](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/variable/CMAKE_LANG_COMPILER_ID.html) check for `Clang` and composes the variables in the Clang-specific manner.\r\n\r\n- What does your PR fix? Fixes issue #10091 \r\n\r\n- Which triplets are supported/not supported? Have you updated the CI baseline? There aren't any 'android' triplets at the minute. I've buddy built this change locally successfully using Android NDK 20.1.5948994 and 21.0.6113669 on Windows.\r\n\r\n- Does your PR follow the [maintainer guide](https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/blob/master/docs/maintainers/maintainer-guide.md)? Yes.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/10285/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/10285/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3271025787,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDMyNzEwMjU3ODc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/3271025787","actor":{"login":"ras0219-msft","id":12301622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzAxNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12301622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft","html_url":"https://github.com/ras0219-msft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"3ae3c41810b0c38a36623f3372fcb3dbac93c8ff","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/commits/3ae3c41810b0c38a36623f3372fcb3dbac93c8ff","created_at":"2020-04-24T21:03:48Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments/619470980","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/10091#issuecomment-619470980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micros